<title>USA: Community Care names Joel Quall CFO.</title>
<headline>Community Care names Joel Quall CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MT. VERNON, N.Y. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Care Services Inc said Thursday that Joel Quall had been appointed chief financial officer, effective December 2.</p>
<p>Quall succeeds Alan Sheinwald, who remains chairman, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Quall was previously a manager at the accounting firm Richard A. Eisner &amp; Co LLP, Community Care said.</p>
